OL,3,GNEWSAThousands turn out in Edinburgh to
OL,4,Aprotest against AI data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have joined a
OL,7,Fprotest in Edinburgh against the
OL,8,Fbuilding of large-scale AI data
OL,9,Fcentres.
OL,11,FDemonstrators with placards - and some
OL,12,Fdressed in costume - assembled at the
OL,13,Ftop of the Royal Mile before marching
OL,14,Ftowards the Scottish Parliament.
OL,16,FThe event is part of a wave of protests
OL,17,Facross Europe, with over 70
OL,18,Fdemonstrations taking place in 15
OL,19,Fcountries this month.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
