OL,3,GNEWSAThousands turn out in Edinburgh to
OL,4,Aprotest against AI data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FInnovation Minister Alyn Smith recently
OL,7,Fsaid AI could deliver "significant
OL,8,Fcommunity benefit" but the
OL,9,Fdemonstration comes at a time of
OL,10,Fwidespread debate about the
OL,11,Fenvironmental impact of data centres.
